//! Gavel: a sealed-bid, uniform-price batch auction written in Fe.
//!
//! - [`bid`]: bids, their priority order and commitments.
//! - [`clock`]: time as an effect, and the auction's phases.
//! - [`book`]: the clearing book, which settles the auction as bids arrive.
//! - [`auction`]: the state machine. It has no `Call` effect, so it cannot
//!   move funds.
//! - [`gavel`]: the contract. It wires the effects together and makes the
//!   transfers.
//! - [`token`]: a minimal ERC-20 to auction.
pub use gavel::{Gavel, GavelMsg}
pub use token::{Erc20Msg, LotToken}
